<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">The </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Hybrid Learning Environment Framework</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> can be used as a discussion tool when developing a hybrid transdisciplinary learning environment.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; line-height: 30.1167px;"></span><a href="https://avans.sharepoint.com/:p:/r/sites/kaders-en-richtlijnen-onderwijs/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B7B3119A1-1EDE-4441-B528-B7E3F74E5BCE%7D&amp;file=Werkkaart%20bij%20Raamwerk%20Leerwerkomgevingen%20AANGEPAST.pptx&amp;action=edit&amp;mobileredirect=true" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Werkkaart bij Raamwerk Leerwerkomgevingen AANGEPAST.pptx (sharepoint.com)</span></span></a><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> (</span><span style="margin: 0px">only</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Avans intern)</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.4833px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">Case </span><span style="margin: 0px">Example</span><span style="margin: 0px">: </span><span style="margin: 0px">HELIOs</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.4833px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">At </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Avans University of Applied Sciences</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">, the concept of </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">HELIOs</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> is used: </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Hybrid External Learning and Innovation Environments</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">. </span><span style="margin: 0px">These are </span><span style="margin: 0px">physical</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">spaces</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">outside</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">walls</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of </span><span style="margin: 0px">educational</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">institutions</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">where</span><span style="margin: 0px"> education, research, </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> professional field, and </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">surrounding</span><span style="margin: 0px"> community (e.g., </span><span style="margin: 0px">neighborhood</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">residents</span><span style="margin: 0px">) </span><span style="margin: 0px">come</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span><span style="margin: 0px">.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">These environments </span><span style="margin: 0px">facilitate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px">bring</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span><span style="margin: 0px"> different </span><span style="margin: 0px">perspectives</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">address</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">societal</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">challenges</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">They</span><span style="margin: 0px"> are </span><span style="margin: 0px">places</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">learn</span><span style="margin: 0px">, research, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">create</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">with</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">others</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">More information and examples of HELIOs can be found in </span><a href="https://magazines.avans.nl/helio-magazine/cover" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">this magazine</span></span></a><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body>
